# Every env file stays out of the build context: anything COPY'd lands in a
# layer (and in the registry build cache). The build gets its env as a BuildKit
# secret instead (see the builder stage in the Dockerfile).
**/.env*
*.md
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
# pnpm-workspace.yaml hanya berisi allowBuilds untuk pnpm >=10 di host. Dockerfile
